{"unit_id":"kezboardpj__dsh-btw#card-zh","repo":"kezboardpj/dsh-btw","commit":"30b042ca3526225ffab29f85cd53a60ce8ad5f59","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-btw-side（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在主智能体继续处理任务时，开启一个并行的只读侧问。它通过 /btw 命令、输入框旁的按钮或悬浮面板接收问题，并创建一次性子代理，将主会话历史作为上下文提供给它，同时禁用所有工具。面板以流式方式显示回答，支持取消和关闭；最近 20 组问答会在当前进程内供后续提问参考。适合需要快速澄清已有对话内容、又不想中断主任务的 DSH Web 用户。需要安装 DSH Web 插件；没有单独的 API key 或外部账号配置。注意一次性子代理记录会保存问答内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:114-176","lib/index.js:272-323","lib/client.js:144-250","lib/client.js:253-278"]}
{"unit_id":"kezboardpj__dsh-btw#card-en","repo":"kezboardpj/dsh-btw","commit":"30b042ca3526225ffab29f85cd53a60ce8ad5f59","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-btw-side lets DSH Web users ask read-only side questions while the main agent works. Start with /btw or the composer panel; a one-shot child agent answers from chat context with tools disabled. Answers stream in the panel, and recent exchanges support follow-ups.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:114-176","lib/index.js:272-323","lib/client.js:144-250","lib/client.js:253-278"]}
